{"sections":[{"slug":"Banach范畴","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"Banach范畴"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"“Banach <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>”"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"“Banach 范畴”"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/加性范畴","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">加性范畴</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> Banach <span lang=\"zh\">结构是其每个态射空间上的</span> Banach <span lang=\"zh\">空间结构</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">满足态射的复合</span>\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}(X,Y) \\times \\operatorname{Hom}(Y,Z) \\to \\operatorname{Hom}(X,Z)\r\n$$\n<span lang=\"zh\">是连续映射</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">带有</span> Banach <span lang=\"zh\">结构的加性范畴称为</span> Banach <span lang=\"zh\">范畴</span>.</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">最重要的例子是</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">向量丛范畴</span></strong>: <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是紧空间</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的向量空间范畴</span> $\\mathcal E(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">有</span> Banach <span lang=\"zh\">结构</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">有趣的是</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">空间上的向量丛范畴等价于代数上的模范畴</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">这是</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数-几何对偶","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>-<span lang=\"zh\">几何对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的一例</span>):</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">定理</span></strong>. <span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">是紧空间</span>, $A=C(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">上的</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">实数或复数值</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">连续函数的</span> Banach <span lang=\"zh\">代数</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">以</span> $\\mathcal P(A)$ <span lang=\"zh\">表示</span> $A$-<span lang=\"zh\">代数范畴</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">那么全局截面函子给出了范畴等价</span> $\\mathcal E(X) \\to \\mathcal P(A)$.</p>\n<p><strong><span lang=\"zh\">证明</span></strong>.</p>\n"}]}}}]}